  "question": {
    "text": "A negative test charge is moving near a long straight wire carrying a current. The force acting on the test charge is parallel to the direction of the current. The motion of the charge is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jxTqK",
      "text": "Away from the wire",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xozhW",
      "text": "Towards the wire",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HGJMT",
      "text": "Parallel to the wire along the current",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nVSxV",
      "text": "Parallel to the wire opposite to the current",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Force on a moving charge,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>motion&#160;of</mtext><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mtext>&#160;is&#160;towards&#160;the&#160;wire.</mtext></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a8f94e4c-3cba-492f-8a8a-6d54c210333f-image.png\" style=\"width: 141px; height: 160px;\" /></p>",
